From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 16:06:27 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] windows.storage: StorageFile, StorageFolder, KnownFolders

- statics: GetFolderFromPathAsync, GetFileFromPathAsync, GetFileFromApplicationUriAsync (ms-appx, ms-appdata)
- StorageFolder: CreateFileAsync/CreateFolderAsync with collision options, GetFile/Folder/ItemAsync,
  TryGetItemAsync, GetFiles/Folders/ItemsAsync (sorted by name), the CommonFileQuery overloads
- StorageFile: OpenAsync/OpenReadAsync/OpenSequentialReadAsync on file-backed streams, CopyAsync,
  MoveAsync, Copy/MoveAndReplaceAsync, FileType, ContentType, IsAvailable
- IStorageItem: Rename/Delete/GetBasicPropertiesAsync (BasicProperties), Name, Path, Attributes,
  DateCreated, IsOfType, IStorageItem2 GetParent/IsEqual, DisplayName/DisplayType
- KnownFolders: the library, capture, camera roll, playlist, saved picture folders and the virtual
  removable devices folder; RequestAccessAsync
- generic completed IAsyncOperation<T *>/IAsyncAction, read-only IVectorView<T *>
- IDL: IStorageFileStatics, IStorageFolderStatics, IStorageItem2, IStorageItemProperties(2), IStorageFolder2,
  IStorageFile2, IStorageFolderQueryOperations, IContentTypeProvider, IInputStreamReference
- ApplicationData and the file classes are registered by their own dll

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XZFS4SPPzeH5d2c1MuzqCS

